 "id": "731817826680892", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_731817830014225_6668945553060767491_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d6BP361Yu5gQ7kNvwHEVFNN&_nc_oc=Adris1lCIbnKNoFrLhWhxK0DD84Xpm2JnJcLZ14tmdv6FpsMahaPUFRGYBEg0qDKSko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6wkdArcpEPpfEFYWMZ2YNR8kTgC6sXkgOMBbb24kZlBQ&oe=69FB35ED"}]}, "id": "1571504523922607", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "shot_00.png", "id": "1995223958043481", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1995223968043480_2531756828121437093_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hg6Ol8UHH4MQ7kNvwHDdKqR&_nc_oc=Adqzc0nJWkDZ2a3YzrGIwA5EszX_lEtDNDbcbWNEWzWD23ue-Ml-HrkBMNB_5R5W_ys&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4ivosqbC3D9av2pLO4rSC--20uE0BzYyPlUNCIG7613w&oe=69FB462D"}, {"file_name": "shot_01.png", "id": "1984039842994267", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_1984039846327600_1230992893492588097_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ND8hdv6M7g0Q7kNvwGcM8kD&_nc_oc=AdprhSKoi1WfGEA6wy2rc_vFPQLAAwcdVI5B7wRVwsYxvvwIkjDqLyZO9ioRcg5e500&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6KIjvpLb46WhfDU_L3oHiOZfkOd3Lj8hagUTMxBhVa4A&oe=69FB4C9A"}, {"file_name": "shot_02.png", "id": "722166304312205", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827725_722166307645538_3695150600320166608_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=guvjB9eKfv4Q7kNvwFqOg3R&_nc_oc=AdpTT4rUjeIPXSCnmigXxzvryK047J2W5zY1JmhpXnbyQtIi6L05UykSwfa2FeHdtZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4wR2KRLbLO-yrjgy4jx3mgBxicEHshzcwN508XRF51ZQ&oe=69FB51E3"}, {"file_name": "shot_03.png", "id": "1338608198074134", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491829165_1338608201407467_3101310761261036756_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nmodoiFydOsQ7kNvwGXRDA9&_nc_oc=Adok4Z0ZohRV9ZvxBUx6kmMlfqUaTUWn6mOdkmiuzEvJUkpGxKe_Ygm2EsHlHexfR6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5WRN8yQ046JEtxXfRma9T-6yDSRn9edbKQ0uYwnfBD-Q&oe=69FB2C0A"}, {"file_name": "shot_04.png", "id": "1997082354522290", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827703_1997082361188956_318146475301101198_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZvBTTdmOBioQ7kNvwH5SSsS&_nc_oc=AdoHNKsAzC8Ofzd_nk5I7WslsSC_GfoXRbR8EahSOfHKBUBmK3jdAS2zBsFi1z435Ps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7yyOb6AFyJhcSCGMUJuRqYR051dl2WlAdRfRQdGmxxRg&oe=69FB4256"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageLandscape2560x1440px.png", "id": "1316761356953064", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822823_1316761360286397_2272191156800823025_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d5zET1z__1sQ7kNvwFM5GLo&_nc_oc=AdrTGY8cJKfMXO1FsGSzbTM8FvwhERoUh89JkMwzoQfitKWLxZPF3XJtP0lK8qo9GEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6OHgsweCkA0gq_9GgkLrWw5XupQX466tlzLAlYPuIC0w&oe=69FB4760"}, "display_name": "InvestiGhost", "keywords": ["ghost", "exploration", "photo", "collectibles", "investigation"], "long_description": "Step into a zany, cartoon-inspired VR spook-fest!\n\nAs a paranormal investigator, explore haunted rooms, solve puzzles, and face off against big bad bosses.\n                                                                                                               \n\n# \u26a0\ufe0f EARLY ACCESS INFO \u26a0\ufe0f\n\n**We're a passionate indie team. The core mechanics are ready!**\n\n**You get 4 playable levels (Tutorials, Coral Riff, Haunted Manor + Boss) and your Office Hub.**\n\n**The photo gallery and upgrade system are still in development.** \n\n**Buy now at a reduced price to support us!**\n\n{935692488974655}\n\nYour best friend is the W.A.L.R.U.S., a multitasking gadget:\n\n- **EctoTracker: Find ghosts and hidden ecto-energy.**\n- **EctoCamera: Snap pics to sell, reveal invisible ghosts, and use the flash to stun them!**\n- **EctoGun: Blast cheeky spirits with plasma (watch your ammo!).**\n- **EctoDrainer: Absorb energy from floating wisps.**\n- **EctoShield: Use your free hand to deflect flying objects.**\n- **Repair System: Convert gathered energy to fix your gadget mid-fight.**\n\nBetween floating furniture and locked doors, every step is a trick-and-treat hunt. Collect \"bonds\" to reveal the Boss\u2019s hidden ectoplasmic heart. Drain the heart while dodging their attacks to win!\n\nWin or lose, you\u2019ll head back to the office to sell photos, repair your gear with your hard-earned cash, and prepare for the next escapade. \n\n**Help us bring this game across the finish line!**\n{2313429015828204}", "short_description": "Step into a cartoon-inspired VR spook-fest! \n\nAs a paranormal investigator, explore haunted places, snap pics of cheeky ghosts, and battle big bosses. \n\nYour W.A.L.R.U.S. gadget is a multitasking wonder: a ghost-detecting camera, plasma blaster, and more.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f EARLY ACCESS: \u26a0\ufe0f\n\nIncludes 4 playable levels (Library, Coral Riff, Manor) & the Office Hub. \n\nUpgrades and the photo gallery are in development. \n\nGrab the game at a special early price and help our indie team finish this adventure!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sylphelabs.com/public/ig4/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sylphe labs s.r.l.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://discord.gg/snr3wtaeGk", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_t